---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../../components/CodeBlock.astro';
---
<DocsLayout title="Configuration | Agent-Gantry">
  <h1>Configuration</h1>
  <p class="lead">Agent-Gantry works with zero configuration, but production systems usually configure routing, persistence, execution, telemetry, and provider extras.</p>

  <CodeBlock lang="python" title="AgentGantryConfig" code={`from agent_gantry import AgentGantry
from agent_gantry.schema.config import AgentGantryConfig

config = AgentGantryConfig(
    vector_store={"type": "lancedb", "db_path": ".gantry/tools.lance"},
    embedder={"type": "nomic"},
    routing={"use_llm_for_intent": False},
    execution={"default_timeout_ms": 30000, "max_retries": 2},
    telemetry={"type": "console"},
)
gantry = AgentGantry(config=config)`} />

  <p>The keys are the field names of the config models: <code>type</code> selects a backend, and <code>db_path</code> is where LanceDB keeps its files. A key a model does not have is ignored without an error, so a misspelt one leaves the default in place (here, an in-memory store and the sentence-transformers embedder) rather than failing. <code>default_timeout_ms</code> and <code>max_retries</code> apply to every call that does not set its own <code>timeout_ms</code> or <code>retry_count</code>; the timeout is per attempt.</p>

  <p>The relevance cutoff is not part of the config. It is a per-query setting:</p>

  <CodeBlock lang="python" code={`tools = await gantry.retrieve_tools(
    "refund an order",
    limit=5,
    score_threshold=0.5,   # raw cosine; the convenience layers default to 0.0
)`} />

  <h2>Common extras</h2>
  <CodeBlock lang="bash" code={`uv add "agent-gantry[openai]"          # OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, OpenRouter
uv add "agent-gantry[anthropic]"       # Claude tools
uv add "agent-gantry[google-genai]"    # Gemini function calling
uv add "agent-gantry[lancedb,nomic]"   # local durable semantic search
uv add "agent-gantry[mcp,a2a]"         # protocol bridges
uv add "agent-gantry[agent-frameworks]"`} />
</DocsLayout>
